# ENI onion paste — torrc for self-hosting a hidden service (run: tor -f torrc)
# Publishes onion_paste.py as a Tor hidden service. Tor writes the .onion to
# tor-data/hs/hostname on first run.
DataDirectory ./tor-data
SocksPort 9050
# Hidden service: ONLY your local paste server (127.0.0.1:8899)
HiddenServiceDir ./tor-data/hs
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8899
# Safety: no exit relay, no clearnet listen
ORPort 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
Log notice file ./tor-data/notice.log
